The 3 Things to Remember
1. Width includes null gaps
width = last position - first position + 1
2. Use virtual indices
left  = 2*i
right = 2*i + 1
3. Normalize indices every level
idx = idx - firstIndex

This avoids huge index growth and is the safest implementation.

